    "description": {
      "en-US": "FTPClient is a very simple FTP, FTPS and SFTP client for Android 5.0+, using Apache Commons Net (https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-net) and SSHJ (https://github.com/hierynomus/sshj/).\n\n<b>Features</b>\n\n- view directory content\n- upload files to servers\n- create directories\n- download files\n- view file and directory properties\n- rename files and directories\n- view text and image files\n- edit text files\n"
    },
